<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελών-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.8
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠνέομαι</span>) <i>farmer</i>
			or <i>collector of tolls, customs</i>, or <i>taxes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				248
			</span></i> (troch.), <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				6.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				31.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				113.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristocl.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				15.2
			</span></i>, etc.: freq. with a sense of reproach, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντες τελῶναι, πάντες εἰσὶν ἅρπαγες</span>, of the
			Oropians, <i><span class="en">
				Xeno
				1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ οἷς ἂν καὶ τελώνης σεμνυνθείη
					βάναυσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.13.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.587
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.804
			</span></i>; = Lat. <i>publicanus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				5.46
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορνοβοσκοὶ καὶ τ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Asp.
				<u>in EN</u>
				102.21
			</span></i>.</div>
